{"id":"f57c523092bba1d6","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-omega-proof.md","title":"Omega Proof","display":"df-omega-proof — Omega Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-omega-proof","aliases":["72-df-omega-proof"],"display":"df-omega-proof — Omega Proof","depends_on":["[[72-df-infinitary-proof]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §3.1, print164–166/PDF176–178; local compatibility alias of 72-df-infinitary-proof","verification_status":"local-interface-checked; inherited-source-proof-limits","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-omega-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-omega-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-proof — Omega Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"80e1d458af53fea9\" href=\"?note=80e1d458af53fea9\" title=\"72-df-infinitary-proof\">72-df-infinitary-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §3.1, print164–166/PDF176–178; local compatibility alias of 72-df-infinitary-proof"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-checked; inherited-source-proof-limits"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"80e1d458af53fea9\" href=\"?note=80e1d458af53fea9\" title=\"72-df-infinitary-proof\">72-df-infinitary-proof</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaProof}_\\mathcal C(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OmegaProof}_\\mathcal C(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不再用两元〈T,λ〉冒充带规则见证的五元对象。ω前提族覆盖全部标准n，其验证条件不隐藏在Remark。</p>\n<p>来源校正：第I章印刷10–12页只有有限PK演算，不能支持ω证明。此处仅为上游五元良基无穷证明对象的兼容别名；原书III章的单侧算术演算与本地通用双侧编码须区分。继承上游的核验限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-infinitary-proof","status":"resolved","id":"80e1d458af53fea9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-infinitary-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-infinitary-proof","status":"resolved","id":"80e1d458af53fea9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 与 $\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C)$ 见 [[72-df-infinitary-proof]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OmegaProof}_\\mathcal C(\\pi):\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C).","display":true}],"bytes":1206,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-omega-proof|df-omega-proof — Omega Proof]]"},{"id":"f63c4c620ad75ba4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma_A}(\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA})$ 及 $\\operatorname{OmegaProof}_{\\mathcal C_{\\rm PA}}$ 取 [[72-df-omega-proof]]：实际证明对象为 $\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C_{{\\rm PA},\\omega},\\eta\\rangle$，已经包含局部合法性与良基性。$\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)=\\ell(())$ 为其根相继式。"}],"outgoing":["80e1d458af53fea9"]}